Text=The English claim they only use magic for defense against dangerous sea creatures, but I have seen English pirates wield devastating magic against innocents. The Armada will be hard pressed against their Weather Wizards. Forgive me if I am too forward, but you have the unmistakable look of an adventurer, used to performing difficult and sometimes questionable tasks...
